# Ex1 conformer check (trans): 用来证明报告里用的 cis 构象确实更低  2-chlorophenol  UKS B3LYP/def2-TZVP  gas phase
# Opt + analytic Freq. Charges, dipole, orbital energies and 298.15 K thermochemistry
# (entropy) are all printed by default.
# RIJCOSX: RI for Coulomb + chain-of-spheres for exchange (hybrid functional)
! UKS B3LYP def2-TZVP def2/J RIJCOSX TightSCF TightOpt Opt Freq

%maxcore 6000

* xyzfile 0 1 ../2Cl_phenol_trans_start_geometry.xyz
